In crate: fixture-crate (0.1.0)

impl Trait in argument position — the whole reason this module exists.

Rustdoc lowers this to a synthetic generic parameter (is_synthetic) literally
named impl Into<Cow<'static, str>>, bounded by the impl's own bounds. Rendering
the parameter list verbatim produces fn set_data<impl Into<Cow<'static, str>>:
Into<Cow<'static, str>>>, which is not Rust.

